+# Billing context
+
+The refund window is 30 days, as defined by `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+For refund disputes, use this window and the customer's documented transaction facts. For invoice questions, rely only on available project and customer evidence; when invoice-specific evidence is missing or ambiguous, escalate instead of inventing an answer.

